  growing:{direct:'Your reserve is taking shape, and that is good to see.',precise:'The reserve you are building here gives me more confidence in your planning.',warm:'I am happy to see your crew gaining a little more room to breathe.',wry:'Your savings have acquired the pleasant habit of looking deliberate.',curious:'It is encouraging to see your plans gaining a reserve behind them.',reflective:'I can see some patience in what you have set aside here.',lively:'That reserve is becoming something you can plan around.'},
