  none:{direct:'It is good to see this branch’s borrowing cleared.',precise:'I am reassured that there is no borrowing left with this branch.',warm:'I am glad this branch is no longer weighing on your plans.',wry:'An empty loan line is a pleasantly uneventful sight.',curious:'I am glad you have room to choose your next commitment here.',reflective:'There is a quiet relief in a promise brought to completion.',lively:'Your borrowing here is clear, and I am pleased to see it.'},
